<title>SWEDEN: Sweden's OM to resume trading at 1450 GMT.</title>
<headline>Sweden's OM to resume trading at 1450 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish futures and derivatives exchange OM said on Monday that trading will resume at 1450 GMT.</p>
<p>Trading was halted earlier on Monday afternoon following technical problems.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
